      "content": "but there isn't really a way to \"just breathe\" when you're standing right on the lip of the abyss. it doesn't feel like a pause or a rest. it feels like the story is just finished. like the ink ran out and there are no more pages left to turn. it's almost peaceful, thinking that maybe the end is just... meant to be here.",
